  entryId: FinalLore
  title: Crumpled Letter inside Drawer
  bodyText: "You made it this far. Doesn\u2019t matter how many times I tried to
    warn them, nobody ever listens. The island isn\u2019t just a trap\u2014it\u2019s
    a mirror. Every secret, every mistake, every scream in the dark, it\u2019s all
    yours now.\r\n\r\nYou\u2019re not the first. You won\u2019t be the last.\r\n\r\nI
    am you."
